{
  "id": 222584461,
  "iid": 10544,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Avoid unnecessary retaps when creating RTP and VOIP dialogs",
  "description": "Similar to 5bc94bc02a9f006a5eec504506a147f48d3101eb. Don't use\nthe automatic connection set up by Qt uic but manually connect\nthe display filter checkbox signal to its slot. This allows us\nto initialize the checkbox and filter status without calling the\nslot and retapping the packets in the middle of constructor.\n\nThere's always an tap triggered at the end of the constructor,\nso we don't want to do a second one before the dialog appears if\nthe main display filter is set.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2023-05-10T01:00:38.031Z",
  "updated_at": "2023-05-10T11:18:42.864Z",
